; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Erica.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>―By the time I left the living room, it was evening.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The affair ran deeper than I had expected.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The Megasawa City case happened to save <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the Motoki-cho case came about through <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu Niimura's</STYLE> will.<PG>
Come to think of it, why <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE> caused the Motoki-cho case is still unknown.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I ask <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> and the others about this too, I'll probably get some kind of clue, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm a little tired, so I'll leave it for later.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, are you done talking?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> was just coming out of the room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Yes..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腰に手1バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"You don't look too lively. Was it pretty rough after all?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"That's... right..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Well, life has its mountains and valleys, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="にんげんばんじさいおうがうま">who knows what's good luck and what's bad</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
With that, <STYLE ID="4">Senpai</STYLE> went down the stairs.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\新村本家2階夕方.gal" "NORMAL" "4" "2000" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> doesn't know yet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why <STYLE ID="2">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE> died.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Senpai</STYLE> probably thinks she was killed by the culprit or something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Doesn't she feel any hatred or anger toward that culprit?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Senpai</STYLE> hasn't shown any sign of it this whole time.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>, doing her best to act cheerful.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe she's being considerate so I won't feel down.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Today <STYLE ID="4">Senpai</STYLE> is kinder than usual, so it bothers me a little.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田夕食.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Dinner that day was very quiet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And a heavy, oppressive atmosphere.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Kana-chan</STYLE> kept glancing around, but maybe because she sensed the mood, she stayed silent the whole time.<PG>
Come to think of it, tomorrow was the day we went back to Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The plan had been to hold the funeral today and finish the whole schedule.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"What's the weather gonna be like tomorrow?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> muttered the question to no one in particular.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Looks like rain from tonight. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">If it doesn't stop by tomorrow morning... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">what'll we do? We can't take the buggy out."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Don't you have a car here?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"We swapped it for the buggy a few years back. It's easier to get around these mountains that way."</STYLE><PG>
If it clears up tomorrow morning, we can go straight back to Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And visit <STYLE ID="8">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE> grave, and have a proper talk with <STYLE ID="9">Sis</STYLE> as well...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家居間.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\皿を置く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Gochisosama desu."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had just one bowl of rice and set down my chopsticks.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh!? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花頭抱える.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">　Whaaat!!? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　What's wrong, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">!? Are you still feeling sick!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"No... it's just that I've been putting on a little weight lately..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Whaaat!? </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> calling herself fat with that body!? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Papa</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, what do you think of </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> figure!?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{QUAKE "人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="3">"C-cough!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At <STYLE ID="7">Kana-chan's</STYLE> question, <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> choked spectacularly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\サクラ\サクラ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="10">"Oh, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="10">, you have to eat more slowly..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And <STYLE ID="10">Sakura-san</STYLE> patted <STYLE ID="3">Kotaro-san</STYLE> on the back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The eyes of everyone watching softened just a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The heavy air grew just a little lighter.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\紅葉のダンス.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Papa</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">! How long are you gonna keep taking baths with me!? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Give it 5 more years and I might be boing-boing like </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... what are you talking about?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">! Actually, today </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Papa</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto-chan's</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Waaaaah! It's nothing, it's nothing!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Everyone burst out laughing a little at how flustered he was.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... everyone knows!? Come on, tell me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手前バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Figure it out with your intuition, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　We're the third generation, after all!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Kana-chan</STYLE>, touching on a blatant taboo.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But everyone already knows about it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since everyone knows, it's already a thing of the past.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So everyone turns it into a joke, even if it has to be forced.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカ指さしバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="11">"Ha ha ha! That's a good one! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="11">　There are plenty of people here who can tell by intuition what </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kotaro</STYLE><STYLE ID="11"> did!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, not you too! Cut it out! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Besides, nobody can see the past, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> don't have intuition anymore, right!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... did you do something that bad for people to find out about? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Don't tell me it was </STYLE><STYLE ID="12" RUBY="のぞ">peeping</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> or something..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手前バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Oh! </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis's</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> intuition just kicked in!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"It wasn't </STYLE><STYLE ID="13" RUBY="のぞ">peeping</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! It was an accident!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\茅萱覗き込み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, was it really an accident!? It wasn't forced!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">had something like that done to me... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">even though it was my first time..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
